  "reading": "The 27 bridge lines are the actual affine qutrit cube hidden inside the golden-selector failure carrier. Each bridge line is coordinatized by which off-anchor line it meets above each of the four anchor points. Those four coordinates obey one F3-linear relation, so any three coordinates give F3^3. Bridge-line intersection is exactly the corrected CDIV 8-generator Cayley graph after a GL(3,3) change of basis.",
